# Environment files hold keys; only the example is tracked.
# .env.production and .env.staging were tracked until 2026-10-14 — the keys
# that were in them are public and must be treated as compromised. CI injects
# every VITE_* value from GitHub secrets, and Vite gives an existing
# process.env entry priority over a dotenv file, so nothing depends on these
# being in the repo.
.env.production
.env.staging
